/span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650170/extras/c0025e3f97ded27cae5ba6af002d3049.avif?t=1788447716\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650170/extras_big/c0025e3f97ded27cae5ba6af002d3049.webp?t=1788447716 width=1560 height=140 /></span><br>Will you be able to follow the rhythm… or fall victim to the cursed dance?<br>A strange melody has swept across Palombia… and all the animals have suddenly started dancing, leaving chaos in their wake! The creature behind this crazy beat is none other than the Mummy Queen, back from the Land of the Dead with her minions to play a cursed concert with a calamitous crescendo.<br><br>Help the Marsupilamis save Palombia from the Mummy Queen and her minions! <br><br>Journey through four vibrant worlds in this high-energy platformer!<br>From the colourful jungle to the bustling city, find the clues to the Mummy Queen's hideout. Take on increasingly more intense challenges leading to the ultimate showdown against the Mummy Queen. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650170/extras/0348f70780824842e6d83775c7258ce2.poster.avif?t=1788447716\" width=1170 height=712 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650170/extras/0348f70780824842e6d83775c7258ce2.webm?t=1788447716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650170/extras/0348f70780824842e6d83775c7258ce2.mp4?t=1788447716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650170/extras/b55f3eadc62fc93d561f5aba815e4b15.avif?t=1788447716\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650170/extras_big/b55f3eadc62fc93d561f5aba815e4b15.webp?t=1788447716 width=1560 height=140 /></span><br>Master the unique abilities of each Marsupilami. Switch characters to soar through the air, punch enemies, or leap across obstacles, and explore the different levels' secrets. Choose your Marsupilami wisely, and you might uncover a hidden level!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650170/extras/22dbccd8174e140503b8bef44630fd8e.poster.avif?t=1788447716\" width=1170 height=774 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650170/extras/22dbccd8174e140503b8bef44630fd8e.webm?t=1788447716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650170/extras/22dbccd8174e140503b8bef44630fd8e.mp4?t=1788447716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650170/extras/db66a43ca04e2299a62bbe10413f23a1.avif?t=1788447716\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650170/extras_big/db66a43ca04e2299a62bbe10413f23a1.webp?t=1788447716 width=1560 height=163 /></span><br>Play the adventure with a friend or on your own and take on the Battle Dojos' challenges and the competitive minigames designed for friendly rivalries.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650170/extras/47365848aed26fcf53cfb2eb5e45ecec.poster.avif?t=1788447716\" width=1170 height=712 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650170/extras/47365848aed26fcf53cfb2eb5e45ecec.webm?t=1788447716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650170/extras/47365848aed26fcf53cfb2eb5e45ecec.mp4?t=1788447716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650170/extras/01dc5df9236808e7d90a75caacfcea7d.avif?t=1788447716\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650170/extras_big/01dc5df9236808e7d90a75caacfcea7d.webp?t=1788447716 width=1560 height=140 /></span><br>Explore unforgettable environments, face memorable bosses, and uncover hidden levels, all set within a fast-paced, fun atmosphere for the whole family.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650170/extras/f6e034c3cbb35c55848d726db95804a5.poster.avif?t=1788447716\" width=1170 height=690 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650170/extras/f6e034c3cbb35c55848d726db95804a5.webm?t=1788447716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650170/extras/f6e034c3cbb35c55848d726db95804a5.mp4?t=1788447716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5 Gen 7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 1050 Ti<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i7 Gen 10 / i7 Gen 11<br></l